+\subsection{SAM3 on GeoFWI3D: Replication Status}
+\label{sec:sam3-results}
+
+The SAM3 replication is not yet a complete three-fold, three-seed
+comparison. The 23 October 2026 inventory contains 110 of the 126 planned
+runs: 76 completed in Colab and 34 completed on the cluster. The remaining
+cells are $D$, $B+D$ and $E+D$ for fold 1, seed 2, and all thirteen
+constrained objectives for fold 3, seed 2. Its baseline is complete.
+Consequently, the available objectives have unequal replication, and
+partial averages do not constitute the final comparison.
+
